    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "590\nFABULOUS\nDisneyland\n© Disneyland Inc. 1935\nTWA takes you comfortably,\nswiftly, to fabulous\nDisneyland. Enjoy all the\nwonders of Fantasyland,\nFrontierland, Adventureland\nand Tomorrowland...\ntake a ride in TWA's\n\"Rocket to the Moon.\"\nTWA is the Official\nAirline to Disneyland -\nFly TWA to Los Angeles\nTWA\nTRANS WORLD AIRLINES\nU.S.A. • EUROPE\nAFRICA • ASIA\nAlong the way of TWA...\nUse your camera-remember your trip with pictures.",
      "Fairy-tale castles ... heroic Indian\nfighters ... jungle scenes, and the TWA\nrocket to the moon-you can see them all in the Magic King-\ndom of Disneyland, only a few hours away by TWA.\nPOST CARD\nUSE\nAIR\nMAIL\nLITHO IN US A.\n2015.166.1563"
    ],
